-- Scontro a squadre (SPEC §5.19, docs/COMBAT.md): the rarer cards' abilities now come 95% of the way
-- to the Delta's 54 points instead of 80% (user's decision of 25 November 2026). With the real kits
-- of every pack character, Omega beat Delta 63.4% of the time at 80; at 95 it is 57.7%, and each
-- rarity beats the one below 48-51%. Two Delta kits went just over 56% at 95 and are lowered a little:
-- Sottovento's supreme (x2.2 to x2.1) and Abdicant's healing (special x0.8 to x0.75, supreme x0.4
-- to x0.35), only if an admin has not changed them from the EDITOR.

update public.game_config set value = '95', updated_at = now() where key = 'combat.rarity_scale_percent';

